<title>USA: Ohio $69 mln state correctional facilities priced.</title>
<headline>Ohio $69 mln state correctional facilities priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Securities said Tuesday it tentatively priced $69.5 million of Ohio state correctional facilities refunding bonds, 1996 Series A, with a top yield of 5.10 percent in 2009.  </p>
<p>STATE OF OHIO</p>
<p>RE: $69,575,000*</p>
<p>(OHIO BUILDING AUTHORITY)</p>
